| ===========================================================================
| traps_se.inc -- SE-era A-line trap macros not defined in traps.inc
|
| Auto-generated by tools/derive_se_traps.py from the SE FDHD ROM bytes.
| Each macro maps the canonical mixed-case Apple trap name to the A-trap
| word (0xAxxx) emitted for that call. Plus-era traps.inc covers ~280 of
| the ~330 traps in System 6/SE; this file fills the SE-specific gap
| (ADB, FDHD, expanded Memory Mgr H*RBit/State, _StripAddress, etc.).
|
| Included from src/rom_se_amalgamated.s after traps.inc, with no
| condition guard -- duplicate macro names would error so each entry must
| be unique to the SE/later ROMs.
| ===========================================================================

